FILE() finds a plain file .T.
FILE(name, 1) agrees for a plain file .T.
FILE() misses one that is not there .F.
FILE(name, 1) agrees there too .F.
plain write hello
additive appends .T.
0 overwrites same as omitted .T.
flag 2 leads with FF FE .T.
flag 4 leads with EF BB BF .T.
EDITSOURCE(cFile) answers 0 headless .T.
EDITSOURCE(cFile, nLine) does too .T.
EDITSOURCE(cFile, nLine, cClass) answers 0 .T.
so does the four-argument form .T.
